      "marker": "[a]",
      "text": "Study Option: Berkeley Biosciences Study Abroad Programme Students who undergo one term of studies at the University of California, Berkeley, USA will take courses offered by the Berkeley Biosciences Study Abroad Programme. Units obtained from the Programme will be recognized as up to 12 units of Major Programme requirement. This option will be recorded on transcript.",
      "subsections": [],
      "rows": []
    },
    {
